[{"answer":"How are you getting on with your art project, Tom?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/1.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, they gave us the theme of birds to base our project on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm not really all that interested in wildlife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/4.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm starting to get into it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I've pretty well finished the introductory stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So have I.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/7.mp3"},{"answer":"When they gave us all those handouts with details of books and websites to look at,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I was really put off,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/9.mp3"},{"answer":"but the more I read, the more interested I got.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I found I could research so many different aspects of birds in art - colour, movement, texture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So I was looking forward to the Bird Park visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What a letdown!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It poured with rain and we hardly saw a single bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Much less use than the trip to the Natural History Museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I liked all the stuff about evolution there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/17.mp3"},{"answer":"The workshop sessions with Dr Fletcher were good too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/18.mp3"},{"answer":"especially the brainstorming sessions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... I missed those because I was ill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I wish we could've seen the projects last year's students did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm. I suppose they want us to do our own thing, not copy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you drafted your proposal yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but I haven't handed it in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to amend some parts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've realised the notes from my research are almost all just descriptions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't actually evaluated anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/27.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'll have to fix that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I didn't know we had to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have to look at that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you do a timeline for the project?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and a mind map.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, so did I.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I quite enjoyed that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/34.mp3"},{"answer":"But it was hard having to explain the basis for my decisions in my action plan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/35.mp3"},{"answer":"What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, give a rationale.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't realise we had to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/38.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I can add it now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And I've done the video diary presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and worked out what I want my outcome to be in the project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Someone told me it's best not to be too precise about your actual outcome at this stage,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/42.mp3"},{"answer":"so you have more scope to explore your ideas later on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/43.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'm going to go back to my proposal to make it a bit more vague.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Really? OK, I'll change that too then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/45.mp3"},{"answer":"One part of the project I'm unsure about is where we choose some paintings of birds and say what they mean to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, I chose a painting of a falcon by Landseer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I like it because the bird's standing there with his head turned to one side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/48.mp3"},{"answer":"but he seems to be staring straight at you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/49.mp3"},{"answer":"But I can't just say it's a bit scary, can I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You could talk about the possible danger suggested by the bird's look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/52.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a picture of a fish hawk by Audubon I like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/53.mp3"},{"answer":"It's swooping over the water with a fish in its talons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and with great black wings which take up most of the picture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/55.mp3"},{"answer":"So you could discuss it in relation to predators and food chains?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well actually I think I'll concentrate on the impression of rapid motion it gives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know that picture of a kingfisher by van Gogh -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/59.mp3"},{"answer":"it's perching on a reed growing near a stream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's got these beautiful blue and red and black shades.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I've actually chosen it because I saw a real kingfisher once when I was little,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I was out walking with my grandfather, and I've never forgotten it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So we can use a personal link?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/65.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/66.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a portrait called William Wells.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't remember the artist but it's a middle-aged man who's just shot a bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And his expression, and the way he's holding the bird in his hand","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/69.mp3"},{"answer":"suggests he's not sure about what he's done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/70.mp3"},{"answer":"To me it's about how ambiguous people are in the way they exploit the natural world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/72.mp3"},{"answer":"There's Gauguin's picture Vairumati.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/73.mp3"},{"answer":"He did it in Tahiti.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/74.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a woman with a white bird behind her that is eating a lizard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and what I'm interested in is what idea this bird refers to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently, it's a reference to the never-ending cycle of existence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I chose a portrait of a little boy, Giovanni de Medici.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/79.mp3"},{"answer":"He's holding a tiny bird in one fist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the way he's holding it carefully so he doesn't hurt it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-part-3-2022-12-29-23-38-48/82.mp3"}]
